Class: AgentGraph

Directed dependency graph of all agents in org.
Backed by MongoDB collection "agent_graph_nodes"
and "agent_graph_edges".
Loaded into memory on startup as NetworkX DiGraph.

Methods:

async load(db: AsyncIOMotorDatabase) -> None
  - Load all nodes and edges from MongoDB
  - Build NetworkX DiGraph in memory
  - Called once at app startup

async upsert_agent(
