=== ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES ===

TACHYON_URL           LLM endpoint
TACHYON_API_KEY       Auth key
TACHYON_MODEL         Model name
GITHUB_TOKEN          For PR comments + check status
GITHUB_WEBHOOK_SECRET For webhook signature validation
MONGO_URI             MongoDB connection string

=== INTEGRATION INTO CODEMIND ===

1. app startup:
   await agent_graph.load(db)

2. IndexerWorker completion hook:
   await index_repo_agents(repo_id, path,
     agent_graph, db)

3. FastAPI app:
   app.include_router(agentguard_router)

4. GitHub webhook handler:
   Route PR events to POST /agentguard/webhook/pr

=== CONSTRAINTS ===

- Python, 4-space indent
- All MongoDB ops via motor (async)
- tree-sitter for all Python AST parsing
- Zero LLM calls in scanner or detector
- Tachyon called only in recommender,
  max_tokens=300
- Fallback recommendation if Tachyon fails —
  never return empty string to developer
- GitHub API: exponential backoff, max 3 retries
- Webhook signature validated on every request
- System prompt never stored raw — hash only
- scan_file never raises — log and return []
- is_blocking: CRITICAL only, never WARNING
- PRReport always populated even if Tachyon fails
- Build FILE 1 first, confirm it compiles,
  then proceed in sequence
